Born in Safad, northern Palestine, around 1888-1890, Ab[bo was] a[ farmer] and[ fisherman] who later took up[ carp]entry[ and] stone masonry. It was not[ until] he moved to Berlin in 1911 to study sculpture that his artistic career took shape.
